                  <provenance type="#b" cert="low" source="425"><orgName role="fmo" key="mlgbOrg_49">Bermondsey, Surrey.
                        Cluniac priory and (from 1399) abbey of St Saviour</orgName><p>Contains on
                        flyleaves parts of a monastic catalogue of books, some with Cluniac
                        interest, and the household expenses of Prince Edward of Windsor in
                        journeying from London to Dover in August and September 1325, a route which
